# game.pdl - the Eden manifest (GAME-CONDUCTOR-ENTITY-AND-EDEN-DESIGN.md section 1). Pipe rows, '#' comments. Last row of a kind wins.
GAME        | title  | Eden
SETUP       | seed   | 7
SETUP       | length | 20
# PARTICIPANT rows are created by Setup as SCRATCH entities from participant_template/ (fresh identity); kit = a name in kits.pdl
PARTICIPANT | asa    | kit=farmer
PARTICIPANT | ava    | kit=farmer
# SPARE rows are what "Add participant" spawns next (one per press)
SPARE       | eli    | kit=farmer
SPARE       | noa    | kit=farmer
# --- v1 (Start game / Stop game): WORLD rows are spawned from world_templates/<kind>/ with fresh ED<n> identities as <kind>_<i>; count= is how many (plant = garden plots).
# PLAYKIT rows are extra kits granted to every participant at Start game.
PLAYKIT     | settler | kit=settler
WORLD       | house   | count=1
WORLD       | chicken | count=2
WORLD       | plant   | count=4
